### Replace these values with your local server, Active Orchestrator and internal Tenant token.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@orchestratorId = replace-with-active-orchestrator-id
@accessToken = replace-with-internal-access-token

### Requires TRANSACTION_SUBMIT. Match currency and extra required fields to the Active schema.
### Sending this invoice twice with the same Tenant/caller returns 409 on the second request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales/{{orchestratorId}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-UC15-001",
  "transactionTime": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "currency": "VND",
  "totalAmount": 20000,
  "items": [
    {
      "productCode": "PRODUCT-001",
      "productName": "Sample product",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 10000,
      "amount": 20000
    }
  ]
}

### Requires TRANSACTION_READ. Results are restricted to the token's Tenant.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Replace the ID with the returned SubmitTransactionResponse.id. Requires TRANSACTION_READ.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/replace-with-invoice-id
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
